WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:16.296
Unlike makeup for a young bride, wedding-parent makeup has to account for sagging skin, thinning hair, and wrinkles — making it the most difficult category in beauty makeup.

2
00:00:16.632 --> 00:00:28.584
But the wedding morning is hectic, with everything squeezed into a set time, leaving no room to deeply discuss things or adjust the style with someone you're meeting for the first time.

3
00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:39.384
A pre-consultation removes that uncertainty — you meet the specialist ahead of time to settle on makeup suited to your face and a hairstyle you're comfortable with,

4
00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:48.624
as well as the right hanbok color, carefully going over each detail, hearing the specialist's advice, and getting your questions answered.

5
00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:54.192
Any personal concerns you have can also be fully discussed.

6
00:00:54.528 --> 00:01:01.944
Between a parent who's prepared this way and one meeting the artist for the first time that morning, which do you think ends up happier with the result?

7
00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:08.616
The morning is so busy that even if you're not happy with it, you have to head straight to the wedding hall.

8
00:01:08.952 --> 00:01:16.992
A one-on-one pre-consultation lets you work out a tailored solution for your specific concerns ahead of time.

9
00:01:17.328 --> 00:01:30.360
The design finalized in the consultation gets recorded on your personal chart, guaranteeing a flawless result on the day — so instead of worrying, you get to look forward to it.
